{'symbol': 'DRE', 'date': '2022-05-11 09:15:00', 'title': 'DUKE REALTY RESPONDS TO ACQUISITION PROPOSAL FROM PROLOGIS, INC.', 'text': "INDIANAPOLIS, MAY 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- DUKE REALTY CORPORATION (NYSE: DRE) (“DUKE REALTY” OR “THE COMPANY”), THE LARGEST DOMESTIC-ONLY LOGISTICS REIT, TODAY RESPONDED TO PROLOGIS, INC.'S (NYSE: PLD) (“PROLOGIS”) NON-BINDING PROPOSAL TO ACQUIRE THE COMPANY IN AN ALL-STOCK TRANSACTION. UNDER THE TERMS OF PROLOGIS' MAY 10, 2022 PROPOSAL, DUKE REALTY SHAREHOLDERS WOULD RECEIVE 0.466 SHARES OF PROLOGIS COMMON STOCK FOR EACH SHARE OF DUKE REALTY COMMON STOCK THEY OWN."}